1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,354
More reactions.

2
00:00:01,354 --> 00:00:05,976
Burnt in air it gives white zinc oxide smoke, philosopher's wool.

3
00:00:05,976 --> 00:00:09,309
With dilute sulphuric acid, hydrogen.

4
00:00:09,309 --> 00:00:18,541
Hot concentrated sulphuric acid gives sulphur dioxide, and very dilute nitric acid is reduced all the way to ammonium nitrate.

5
00:00:18,541 --> 00:00:23,658
Zinc at minus zero point seven six volts displaces most metals.

6
00:00:23,658 --> 00:00:28,919
And in alkali it reduces nitrate to ammonia, a test for nitrate.

